  "solution": "**Explanation:**\n\nThe pattern followed in the given sets is:\n\n First term** + Second term - 6 = **Third term** **\n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given sets:\n\n(111, 208, 313)\n\n__**111 + 208**__ - 6 = 313\n\n__**319 **____**- 6**__ = 313\n\n313 = 313\n\n(36,12, 42)\n\n__**36 + 12**__ - 6 = 42\n\n__**48 - 6**__ = 42\n\n42 = 42 \n\nNow we apply the pattern on the given options:\n\nOption 1) (41, 69, 107)\n\n__**41 + 69**__ - 6 = 107\n\n__**110 - 6**__ = 107\n\n104 ≠ 107\n\nOption 2) (66, 92, 151)\n\n__**66 + 92**__ - 6 = 151\n\n__**158 - 6**__ = 151 \n\n152 ≠ 151\n\nOption 3) (120, 224, 342)\n\n__**120 + 224**__ - 6 = 342\n\n__**344 - 6**__ = 342\n\n338 ≠ 342\n\nOption 4) (28, 51, 73)\n\n__**28 + 51**__ - 6 = 73\n\n__**79 - 6**__ = 73 \n\n73 = 73\n\n**Hence the correct answer is option 4.**",
